  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>a</mi></math> be any real number.<br /><math><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></munder></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></munder></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> (when <math><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>a</mi></math> through rational values)<br /><math><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></munder></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></munder></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></math> (when <math><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>a</mi></math> through irrational values)<br /><math><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></munder></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math> will exist only when <math><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></math><br />i.e., when <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />Thus, if <math><mi>a</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>1</mn></math> or <math><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> then <math><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></munder></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math> will not exist<br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> will be discontinuous at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math> where <math><mi>a</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>1</mn></math> or <math><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
